feat(ui): iOS bubble corner radii (16, grouped side 8)

DESIGN_SPEC section 3: iOS uses a 16pt main corner radius and an 8pt
radius on the grouped side of consecutive bubbles
(TelegramUIPreferences/Sources/PresentationThemeSettings.swift:561).
Android used 17dp and 6dp.

- SharedConfig: default bubbleRadius 16. Users who moved the slider keep
  their value.
- MessageDrawable: grouped-side radius 8 instead of 6 (text and media
  bubbles). The tail geometry (smallRad) is unchanged.
- ThemeActivity: the reset check uses the new default.
>>> replace_line TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/SharedConfig.java
>>> find
public static int bubbleRadius = 17;
>>> text
    public static int bubbleRadius = 16; // unofficial client: iOS main bubble radius (DESIGN_SPEC 3)
>>> replace TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/SharedConfig.java
>>> find
preferences.getInt("bubbleRadius", 17)
>>> replace
preferences.getInt("bubbleRadius", 16)
>>> replace TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/ActionBar/MessageDrawable.java count=4
>>> find
dp(Math.min(6, SharedConfig.bubbleRadius))
>>> replace
dp(Math.min(8, SharedConfig.bubbleRadius))
>>> replace TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/ActionBar/MessageDrawable.java count=2
>>> find
nearRad = dp(6);
>>> replace
nearRad = dp(8);
>>> replace TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/ThemeActivity.java
>>> find
SharedConfig.bubbleRadius != 17
